  positionTitle: Vice President of Everything
  jobDescription: Lead the company into the future. Make big decisions. Attend many
    meetings. Must not cause the downfall of civilization.
  bossMemo: 'Final day! Our VP retired yesterday to ''live on a boat and never answer
    an email again''. We need a new Vice President of Everything.


    Also... between
    you and me... the CEO''s nephew Tanner is applying. The CEO would be VERY happy
    if Tanner got the job. Very happy. Do with that what you will.


    Oh, and
    HR added a rule because of what happened in 2019. We don''t talk about 2019.


    -
    Dale'
  newRules:
  - VP candidates must have real management experience.
  - Absolutely no time travelers. We've been over this.
